        <mxCell id="scope-notes" value="Repeated rectangles refer to the same entity/store. Customer and Labor have no login role in the supplied use case.&#10;*Labor and D3 service flows are retained from the previous Level 0; they are not covered by the supplied use case.&#10;D6 is the aggregate of D1-D4 for backup/restore, not an additional physical database." style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1" connectable="0">
